%% ADR-221 D1 / RF-09 / B-ENDED-1
%% FSM de deteccao de fim de track Spotify a partir de player_state_changed.
%% Estado guardado no driver: lastPositionMs, wasPlaying, lastTrackUri,
%% endedEmittedForUri (dedupe). Emite 'ended' UMA vez por faixa.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Idle: load(track)\nendedEmittedForUri=null

    Idle --> Playing: play() / SDK reporta\npaused=false, pos crescente
    note right of Playing
        a cada player_state_changed:
        atualiza lastPositionMs=pos
        wasPlaying = !paused
        lastTrackUri = current_track.uri
    end note

    Playing --> Playing: timeupdate\n(pos cresce, paused=false)
    Playing --> PausedMid: paused=true\n& pos no MEIO\n(lastPos < 0.95*dur)
    PausedMid --> Playing: resume()\n(paused=false)
    note left of PausedMid
        pause manual no meio:
        NAO emite ended
        (C1/C3 falham, faixa nao
         migrou p/ previous_tracks)
    end note

    Playing --> EvalEnded: paused=true & pos=0\nOU lastTrackUri em\nprevious_tracks\nOU pos>=dur

    state EvalEnded <<choice>>
    EvalEnded --> EmitEnded: (C1 || C2 || C3)\n&& endedEmittedForUri\n!= lastTrackUri
    EvalEnded --> Playing: dedupe bloqueia\n(ja emitiu p/ esta uri)

    EmitEnded --> Ended: emit('ended')\nendedEmittedForUri = lastTrackUri
    note right of EmitEnded
        C1: wasPlaying && paused && pos==0
            && lastPositionMs >= 0.95*dur
        C2: lastTrackUri in previous_tracks
            && (cur != lastTrackUri || cur==null)
        C3 (legado): paused && dur>0 && pos>=dur
    end note

    Ended --> Idle: load(nova faixa)\nendedEmittedForUri=null
    Ended --> [*]: destroy()
